    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i've heard that people with gastritis take advil all the time as long as they have a proton pump inhibitor like omeprazole in their system to coat the stomach. i really don't want to go to a doctor or anything right now, i just need to know if it's safe to just take a couple of 400mg advil every 6 hours for the next few days until i can get to the dentist. is that a bad idea or is that fine since i'm already on the omeprazole?",
